{"id":"853cb327fc96bb62","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property.md","title":"ZFC Filter6 Finite Intersection Property","display":"df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property — ZFC Filter6 Finite Intersection Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property"],"display":"df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property — ZFC Filter6 Finite Intersection Property","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-finite]]","[[58-df-intersection]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property — ZFC Filter6 Finite Intersection Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fde8356a8733e94f\" href=\"?note=fde8356a8733e94f\" title=\"58-df-intersection\">58-df-intersection</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (underlying set)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> (family with finite intersection property)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (finite subfamily of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A\">\\(\\mathcal A\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\">\\([A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in[\\mathcal A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in[\\mathcal A]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC filter definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-intersection","status":"resolved","id":"fde8356a8733e94f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-intersection]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}$，其中 $\\mathrm{Finite}$ 见 [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S","display":false},{"tex":"[A]^{<\\omega}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathcal P(A):\\mathrm{Finite}(B)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter6\\text{-}finite\\text{-}intersection\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilter6FiniteIntersectionProperty}_S(X,\\mathcal A)\\leftrightarrow X\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\mathcal A\\subseteq\\mathcal P(X)\\land\\forall\\mathcal B\\in[\\mathcal A]^{<\\omega}\\;\\bigl(\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\to\\bigcap\\mathcal B\\neq\\emptyset\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1240,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1903","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-filter6-finite-intersection-property.m